<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Black &amp; Decker started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Black &amp; Decker started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Black &amp; Decker Corp was started with a buy rating by Lehman Brothers on Friday, according to a research report.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 40-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Lehman said the company was moving to drive operating profit margins to 13 percent.</p>
<p>-- It forecast a 1997 rise in operating profit of 15 percent and earnings per share of $2.65.</p>
</text>
